{"data":{"body":"[P2] Match the diagnostic emitted by the current provider. `OtelPluginSupport.requireSameThreadInvocationHooks()` emits this message without `(2.2.2 lifecycle capability)`. When the supplied older core lacks that capability, both `old/new` views therefore fail with `wrong capability rejection diagnostic`, making the documented matrix exit unsuccessfully. Update this constant to match the provider and cover the actual rejection path; the self-test only compares copies of the same constant.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc8AAAABAiUgSA","finding_digest":"7ebd5a7fa137c97e14f23d941a70ebdc96ea435392b89d8f4107ec0aa9e14b81","finding_id":"arf_v1_p26vu75bg7ex4fhshwkbu4hl3s","finding_key":"otel-plugin/src/test/compatibility/pluginlayercompatibilityprobe.java::capability_diagnostic::provider-diagnostic-mismatch","identity_key":"otel-plugin/src/test/compatibility/pluginlayercompatibilityprobe.java::capability_diagnostic::provider-diagnostic-mismatch","line":37,"observation_digest":"9c5afcc6600a45b98083bba3f6028adb5399f9dae4efbf54fc1f88cdddf88fc1","observation_id":"aro_v1_trnpzrtabjc3taedxor7mauk3n","path":"otel-plugin/src/test/compatibility/PluginLayerCompatibilityProbe.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-20T22:21:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_e72zrwr4fvtifgsdmmdw7lkfjr","reviewed_base_sha":"d64973fc6b1fb2fe69c0bce421e99a4aad417add","reviewed_head_sha":"1d6885d79d63408867b7e84fa21f411333b03bfe","reviewer":"codex","start_line":37,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_fbqqcimkqx5gmwo3vojmxyqsru"},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_n3kpx2ju4nntywjpfybilxfaxi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-20T22:21:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
